1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,614
AI insiders reportedly expect a major AI disaster
within a year. What are they getting ready?

2
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:13,043
Most likely a cyberattack: banks,
internet, power, water.

3
00:00:13,993 --> 00:00:19,471
Their reported plan: brief Congress, and
shape the rules that come after.

4
00:00:20,421 --> 00:00:25,900
One rule on the list: a required kill
switch.

5
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:32,479
The off switch: the day after. Until then:
the sticky note.
